# Synthetic P21/c cell. Not a published structure.
#
# The ordered C-O sits inside the cell and is the formula unit, so that
# drawing has no disorder. The second C-O is split into two orientations
# and crosses the a face (1.44 angstrom across the boundary), so the unit
# cell repeats it as visual copies. Symmetry expansion puts disordered
# sites outside the asymmetric-unit drawing and inside the cluster.
